  "title": "Zabbix: Replace json_validate() with json_parse() to support large objects",
  "description": "About `json_validate()` in https://www.wireshark.org/docs/wsar_html/wsjson_8h.html#a01b892da8d09a22bb4c8fb1d9942fe5f:\n\n> This requires that the buffer be complete valid JSON that requires no more than 1024 tokens.\n\nso it fails with large JSON.\n\nJust use `json_parse()` instead and check the return value.\n\nSample capture: [zabbix-large-json.pcapng](/uploads/b5e543d697510e3339cbf72fad14b3a8/zabbix-large-json.pcapng)",
